WEBVTT

00:00:00.319 --> 00:00:02.967
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> More sophisticated emotions

00:00:03.553 --> 00:00:04.213
1

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.120
Adjectives to describe emotions

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.202
<b>Happiness</b>

00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:11.990
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:16.055
<v><b>F:</b></v> Both ecstatic and overjoyed are possible.

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:18.725
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:21.137
<v><b>M:</b></v> Pleased is correct.

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:23.871
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:27.808
<v><b>F:</b></v> Both contented and satisfied are possible.

00:00:29.558 --> 00:00:30.406
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.382
<v><b>M:</b></v> Exhilarated is correct.

00:00:35.336 --> 00:00:36.192
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.905 --> 00:00:38.909
<v><b>F:</b></v> Upbeat is correct.

00:00:41.877 --> 00:00:43.061
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Sadness</b>

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:44.644
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:45.384 --> 00:00:47.566
<v><b>M:</b></v> Devastated isn’t possible.

00:00:49.372 --> 00:00:50.117
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:50.949 --> 00:00:52.865
<v><b>F:</b></v> Gutted isn’t possible.

00:00:54.745 --> 00:00:55.675
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:56.335 --> 00:00:58.510
<v><b>M:</b></v> Wistful isn’t possible.

00:01:00.373 --> 00:01:01.215
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:01.982 --> 00:01:04.070
<v><b>F:</b></v> Listless isn’t possible.

00:01:05.883 --> 00:01:06.805
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:07.577 --> 00:01:09.305
<v><b>M:</b></v> Upset isn’t possible.

00:01:11.867 --> 00:01:12.696
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Anger</b>

00:01:13.396 --> 00:01:14.224
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:01:15.251 --> 00:01:22.494
<v><b>F:</b></v> Livid is the best option. Exasperated is possible. Cross is wrong.

00:01:24.363 --> 00:01:25.039
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:33.247
<v><b>M:</b></v> Peeved is the best option. Indignant is possible. Outraged is wrong.

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:36.020
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:43.698
<v><b>F:</b></v> Resentful is the best option. Offended is possible. Livid is wrong.

00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:46.400
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:47.154 --> 00:01:52.465
<v><b>M:</b></v> Frustrated is the best option. Peeved and displeased are wrong.

00:01:54.321 --> 00:01:55.181
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:55.980 --> 00:02:02.642
<v><b>F:</b></v> Irate is the best option. Incensed is possible. Cross is wrong.

00:02:05.563 --> 00:02:07.545
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Fear and anxiety</b>

00:02:08.435 --> 00:02:09.235
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:02:10.008 --> 00:02:11.237
<v><b>M:</b></v> panic-stricken

00:02:13.073 --> 00:02:13.851
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:02:14.697 --> 00:02:15.638
<v><b>F:</b></v> rattled

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:18.346
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:02:19.079 --> 00:02:20.110
<v><b>M:</b></v> aghast

00:02:21.876 --> 00:02:22.713
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:02:23.493 --> 00:02:24.453
<v><b>F:</b></v> wary

00:02:26.192 --> 00:02:27.059
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:02:28.018 --> 00:02:28.939
<v><b>M:</b></v> uneasy